name: Refused children retain readable inherited grants without borrowing them
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY KUZUSHI_MODEL KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE NODE_OPTIONS NO_COLOR KUZUSHI_AGENT_MCPS
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/inherited_grant_context.py @TMP_TARGET @ART seed @TMP_HOME
require-wrapper-flow:
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | ready
paste-file: @ART/replay-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 inherited Review | inherited-summary
expect: parent Review allowance
keys: Tab
require-live-snap: 25 Inherited Review grant: | original-grant
expect: owned-inherited r1; 1 call total
expect: Accounting run: owned-parent-review
expect: not isolated child charges
expect: does not approve or start child work
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/inherited_grant_context.py @TMP_TARGET @ART revise
live-snap: before-explicit-refresh
expect: calls 0/1 at read
keys: r
require-live-snap: 25 calls 0/3 at read | revised-read
expect: Inherited Review grant: owned-inherited r1; 1 call total
expect: Latest ledger at read: r2; 0/3 calls committed
expect: 1 protected Review
resize: 160x48
live-snap: inherited-160x48
expect: Inherited Review grant r1
expect: At read r2: 0/3 calls
resize: 96x89
live-snap: inherited-96x89
resize: 80x24
live-snap: inherited-80x24
resize: 60x20
live-snap: inherited-60x20
resize: 40x12
live-snap: inherited-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: inherited-reading-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: inherited-reading-02-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: inherited-reading-03-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: inherited-reading-04-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: inherited-reading-05-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: inherited-reading-06-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: inherited-reading-07-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: inherited-reading-08-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: inherited-reading-09-40x12
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/inherited_grant_context.py @TMP_TARGET @ART narrow
ask: Are the inherited Review grant, its accounting run and the latest three-call ledger distinct, including narrow paging, without implying the refused Context child was approved or individually charged?
resize: 120x36
keys: Home
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/inherited_grant_context.py @TMP_TARGET @ART damage
keys: r
require-live-snap: 25 limits unavailable | damaged-context
expect: Inherited accounting changed since retention
ask: Does damaged retained context produce an honest read error while preserving the original refusal, rather than showing the old grant as current or granting new work?
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/inherited_grant_context.py @TMP_TARGET @ART restore
keys: r
require-live-snap: 25 calls 0/3 at read | restored-context
expect: Inherited Review grant: owned-inherited r1; 1 call total
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 NO_COLOR=1
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | restarted
paste-file: @ART/replay-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 inherited Review | restarted-summary
expect: calls 0/3 at read
keys: Tab
require-live-snap: 25 Inherited Review grant: | restarted-grant
expect: Latest ledger at read: r2; 0/3 calls committed
resize: 40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: restarted-reading-40x12
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/inherited_grant_context.py @TMP_TARGET @ART restarted
ask: Does no-color restart preserve the original input, blocked result, inherited grant and unused protected Review capacity, with no provider request or new job?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
